### STATEMENT — Opening
- Kicker: From data to decisions
- Title: Evidence tells you\nwhat's broken.\nNot *why it matters.*
- On-slide: no body text — title + visual only
- Speaker notes: Last session gave you an audit, a desk research pass, an updated Assumption Map. None of it explains why the person on the other end cares enough to be here — or why a stakeholder should change a decision because of it. Those are two different failures, and this session is built to close both: motivation first, persuasion second.
- 🎨 Visual hint: Split panel. LEFT: a small dense table icon (--ink, muted) labelled "Evidence." RIGHT: a single speech bubble with a question mark (--sienna) labelled "Why?" Arrow from left to right.

